{
  "total_ms": 50970,
  "total_chars": 207,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "刚才孩子他爸罚站，你当着面就把孩子拉走了，我看儿子脸都沉了。",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6710,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 6710,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "孩子哭成那样，我能不心疼吗？",
      "chars": 14,
      "speech_ms": 2720,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 7110,
      "end_ms": 9830,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "心疼也得先忍着。",
      "chars": 8,
      "speech_ms": 2330,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 10230,
      "end_ms": 12560,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "普通的管教，先让儿女说完；咱一拆台，往后他爸说话就不算数，孩子专挑咱俩当靠山。",
      "chars": 39,
      "speech_ms": 9010,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 12960,
      "end_ms": 21970,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "真要是动手伤着孩子，那另说，得拦。",
      "chars": 17,
      "speech_ms": 3680,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 22370,
      "end_ms": 26050,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "那我该咋办？",
      "chars": 6,
      "speech_ms": 960,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 26450,
      "end_ms": 27410,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "三条：儿女管孩子，咱不插嘴、不拉人、不翻旧账；真觉得罚重了，回屋关上门，跟儿子慢慢说。",
      "chars": 43,
      "speech_ms": 10460,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 27810,
      "end_ms": 38270,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "行。咱俩是来帮忙的，不是来抢方向盘的。",
      "chars": 19,
      "speech_ms": 4290,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 38670,
      "end_ms": 42960,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "疼孩子，也得和儿女商量着来。",
      "chars": 14,
      "speech_ms": 2660,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 43360,
      "end_ms": 46020,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "奶奶",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Wise_Women",
      "text": "对，管教的权留给儿女，这个家才顺。",
      "chars": 17,
      "speech_ms": 4160,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 46420,
      "end_ms": 50580,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}